            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "spv_glass_boundary_structural_order_parameter_qc = 3.818 dimensionless" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Mean observed shape index <q> interpolated at the SPV glass boundary across the v0 grid (0.05, 0.15, 0.3, 0.45) at D_r=1 (std=0.0128); Bi et al. (2016) PRX Fig. 4: q_c ~= 3.81 independent of (v0, D_r)" ;
